sequenceDiagram
  participant ORD as ORDER-SERVICE
  participant PAY as PAYMENT-SERVICE
  participant DB as payment_db

  ORD->>PAY: Charge orderId, amount, method
  PAY->>DB: Insert payment PENDING
  PAY->>PAY: Mock processor SUCCESS or FAILED
  alt SUCCESS
    PAY->>DB: status SUCCESS
    PAY-->>ORD: PaymentResponse SUCCESS
  else FAILED
    PAY->>DB: status FAILED + reason
    PAY-->>ORD: PaymentResponse FAILED
  end
